# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data. Nothing derived from a real statement belongs in this repository.
# See docs/PRIVACY.md — this list is the second line of defence, not the first;
# CI also fails if any data file becomes tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Wherever statements get dropped.
/statements/
/data/
Documents/
documents/
uploads/

# Statement and export formats.
*.pdf
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.CSV

# The database is your entire financial history in one file.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
storage/
backend/storage/

# Generated report output.
ingest_out/
*_extracted.json
*_extracted.csv

# One deliberate exception: a sample report built from the synthetic dataset, so
# the README can show what the output looks like. `tests/test_privacy.py` asserts
# it contains only synthetic payees.
!docs/sample-report.pdf

